+        <h2><a class="post-link" href="insights-real-governance.html">The year non-medical benefits came under real governance</a></h2>
+        <p class="dek">In the same year, federal and state regulators moved to make non-medical benefit and HCBS execution documented, verifiable, and producible on demand. From Medicare to Medicaid, a benefit you offered is becoming a decision you have to defend.</p>
+        <div class="post-meta"><span>8 min read</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span><span>Flagship</span></div>
       </div>
