+            <span class="post-tag">Policy &amp; CMS</span>
+            <h3><a class="post-link" href="insights-vbid-to-ssbci.html">Same benefits, fewer members, a determination for each one</a></h3>
+            <p class="dek">The VBID sunset moved most D-SNP supplemental benefits onto SSBCI authority. The basis on which a member qualifies changed from a status to a determination for each individual.</p>
